[{"answer":"Many people are afraid of bugs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Some bugs do bad things like eating crops or clothes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Some bugs, such as termites, even eat wood.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Other bugs can be good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Spiders catch flies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Flies are not good because they carry germs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Insects get caught in the web that the spider builds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Ants get into homes and eat food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Bees are good because honey comes from bees.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It is not good if you get stung by a bee.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/10.mp3"},{"answer":"A caterpillar turns into a butterfly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Butterflies can be very beautiful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/12.mp3"},{"answer":"You can find grasshoppers outside on a sunny day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Grasshoppers hop through the grass.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Crickets make a noise by rubbing their legs together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Dragonflies usually live near water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/16.mp3"},{"answer":"They have large, colorful wings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Ladybugs are red with little black dots.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/18.mp3"},{"answer":"There are many types of beetles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Nobody wants to have cockroaches in their house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Centipedes have many legs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Fleas get onto your pets and bite them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/22.mp3"},{"answer":"They make your dog or cat itchy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Mosquitoes can make you itchy when they bite you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you ever had a mosquito bite?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/47-bugs-2019-03-29-10-18-31/25.mp3"}]
